The f3s cluster outgrew my desk. A while back I wrote about the DeskPi RackMate T0 sitting on my desk — a cute 4U setup for audio gear and a switch. The actual compute stuff lived elsewhere behind my TV.

=> ./2026-02-22-my-desk-rack.gmi My desk rack: DeskPi RackMate T0

=> ./f3s-kubernetes-with-freebsd-part-10/rack-overview.jpg The new 8U RackMate T1 next to the electricity main box

So I got the bigger sibling: an 8U DeskPi RackMate T1, a 10-inch mini server cabinet. It's now mounted on the wall right next to my apartment entrance, sitting under the electricity main box and the internet router.

